= 1 August 1974 — Into southern Alsancak

“Turkish forces had entered the southern part of Karavas but remained outside Lapithos … in the evening of 1 August entered Bellapais.”

[S/11353/Add.13, paragraph 2 — UN report excerpt.](https://digitallibrary.un.org/record/484550/files/S_11353_Add.13-EN.pdf)


- @historical: Secure southern Alsancak and consolidate the Bellapais approaches.
- @alternative: Maintain the existing line and pursue monitored access instead of new entry into disputed areas.

